WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.168
Welcome to the Cursor Community welcome screen — a configurable display for workshops and events.

2
00:00:06.168 --> 00:00:15.264
The home screen opens with an animated Cursor logo, your community brand, a headline, and today’s date over a floating particle backdrop.

3
00:00:15.264 --> 00:00:21.528
The brand name is the hero signal — swap it for your chapter or community without touching code.

4
00:00:21.528 --> 00:00:27.432
The headline welcomes attendees and animates word by word for a polished stage presence.

5
00:00:27.432 --> 00:00:32.688
The live date updates automatically, or you can lock in a fixed event date from the editor.

6
00:00:32.688 --> 00:00:40.300
Top-right controls open the editor, enter presentation mode, or copy a shareable link with your settings.

7
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:43.128
Press E, F, or P as keyboard shortcuts.

8
00:00:43.128 --> 00:00:46.772
Click Edit — or press E — to open the sidebar.

9
00:00:46.772 --> 00:00:51.525
Customize brand, title, date, replay interval, and sponsors.

10
00:00:51.525 --> 00:00:54.456
Everything persists in local storage.

11
00:00:54.456 --> 00:01:03.600
Tune the date with Use today or a fixed day, set animation replay from five to sixty seconds, and add up to five sponsor titles and names.

12
00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:11.520
After editing, the stage reflects your chapter name, meetup headline, and sponsor line-up — ready for the event.

13
00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:17.352
Sponsors appear beneath the date so partners get a clear moment on screen during the welcome loop.

14
00:01:17.352 --> 00:01:25.536
Re-open the editor anytime to add or remove sponsors, reset to defaults, or refine the welcome copy before doors open.

15
00:01:25.536 --> 00:01:32.376
Share copies a link with your configuration encoded in the URL so teammates open the same welcome screen instantly.

16
00:01:32.376 --> 00:01:40.392
Preview — or press F or P — enters fullscreen presentation mode and hides chrome so the welcome screen fills the stage.

17
00:01:40.392 --> 00:01:43.299
The footer credits the maker and Cursor.

18
00:01:43.299 --> 00:01:50.568
That covers the full welcome experience — motion, editing, sponsors, sharing, and presentation mode.
